  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterOffice2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Hey. Knew you\u2019d show up. Got you a soda in advance."
  - ?!...
  - Okay. Thanks. Why are you looking at me like that?
  - You look really disappointed again. Brother trouble?
  - "Um\u2026 no? Why would you think that?"
  - "I overheard some of your conversations. And everything I heard sounded\u2026
    not great."
  - "Well\u2026 what, are you stupid? You think families don\u2019t fight? He\u2019ll
    sulk, then get over it\u2026"
  - Is it always like that with you two?
  - Yeah. Is that weird?
  - "Hm\u2026 You know what I think? I think you pay too much attention to people
    who don\u2019t want it. Every time I hear Cyber, I\u2019m convinced."
  - "It\u2019s not about attention\u2026 we barely talk. He\u2019s mad at me because
    he\u2019s not living like a corporate golden boy anymore."
  - "Anyway, you didn\u2019t finish your thought. What are you suggesting?"
  - Shift your focus onto something else.
  - Like what?
  - Like me, for example.
  - WHAT?!
  - "I mean\u2014 uh\u2014 sorry, what?"
  - "Let\u2019s go to the bar. Have a drink. Not much \u2014 one beer each. "
  - "We can\u2019t drink here anyway. You can complain about all your \u201Cfamily
    conflicts.\u201D"
  - "Uh\u2026 I\u2026 don\u2019t like alcohol\u2026"
  - "Then I\u2019ll buy you another soda. The kind you like. Come on."
  - "If we\u2019re going to the bar then\u2026 milkshake. Vanilla. And we go\u2026
    late at night. When everyone\u2019s asleep\u2026"
  - Milkshake. Got it. Deal.
